# Security response headers for hosts that honor this file (Cloudflare
# Pages, Netlify) or as the reference set for a fronting proxy's transform
# rules. GitHub Pages ignores it (it cannot set response headers — the
# reason securityheaders.com grades Pages-hosted sites F); the meta CSP in
# templates/base.html provides the browser-enforced subset there.
#
# script-src carries no 'unsafe-inline'. Production allows the site's inline
# <script> blocks by sha256 hash (a Cloudflare transform rule written by
# ops/cloudflare/refresh_csp_hashes.py), and a reference set that is weaker
# than what production enforces is worse than no reference at all: anyone who
# adopts it believes they copied the real policy while actually running one
# under which an injected <script> executes.
#
# The hash tokens are deliberately absent here rather than pinned. They are
# taken over RENDERED HTML, and two of the inline scripts contain Tera
# expressions, so the template text this repository stores is not enough to
# compute them — a pinned list would be a guess that goes stale on the next
# site edit. Shipping without them fails CLOSED: the site's own inline
# scripts are blocked until the list is filled in, which shows up as a dead
# nav on the first page load instead of as a silent hole. Fill it in from the
# built site before serving from a host that honors this file:
#
#   cd website && zola build
#   python3 ops/cloudflare/refresh_csp_hashes.py \
#       --site-dir website/public --write-headers website/public/_headers --dry-run
#
# style-src keeps 'unsafe-inline' because the templates carry ~141 inline
# style= attributes, which CSP cannot hash.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.bunny.net; font-src https://fonts.bunny.net; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
